    "rules": [
      "Instance repeated lane props and bottles.",
      "One shared material set per semantic material wherever possible.",
      "Bake subtle roughness/normal variation; do not use large uncompressed photo textures.",
      "LOD0/LOD1 for architecture and hero props; mobile may omit micro-props.",
      "No per-prop dynamic shadow lights; practical lights share the host lighting budget.",
      "Prefer KTX2/Basis textures and Meshopt/Draco-compatible GLBs in production build."
    ]
  },
